=== interpretation ===
atom_size=56 is sizeof(struct base_jd_atom_v2), enforced by _Static_assert.
stride=64 is what KBASE_IOCTL_JOB_SUBMIT requires; 56 misbehaves.
event=0x4 is BASE_JD_EVENT_TERMINATED (DONE is 0x01), yet target shows
0x2a2a2a2a, i.e. the atom's write DID reach memory. Why a completed write
reports TERMINATED is NOT RESOLVED.
